he post. Nothing in the animal kingdom emotes better than an owl. (thx, david)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/birds\">birds</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/05/owls-in-towels\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"fe785945894be7e935d12d6baa825804d3c08aea01e991e2f43cf9fb7c78232e","category":"Sites"}